          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new run: what did bēga mean, and what did hāgādare mean?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಿನಂತಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿನಂತಿ (vinanti) — \"a request\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿನಂತಿ (vinanti) is the naming-word for the thing ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು has been doing for you since the please-chapter. ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು is how you make one; ವಿನಂತಿ (vinanti) is what you have made."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sanskrit, and its shape says a bending — the asker lowers himself a little, and that is exactly the difference between a ವಿನಂತಿ (vinanti) and an instruction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The first of five courtesy words."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "vinanti",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *vinanti*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "it once more, slowly",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: it once more, slowly]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "dayaviṭṭu, then vinanti, and say which one goes inside a sentence",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *dayaviṭṭu*, then *vinanti*, and say which one goes inside a sentence]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ವಿನಂತಿ (vinanti) mean? (\"a request\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
